claim.claim-text:
performing in the first working mode, by the robotic mower, a self-propelled mowing operation in a working area;
recording, by the robotic mower, the working area where the self-propelled mowing operation has been completed in the first working mode and marking it as a mowed area; and
controlling in the second working mode, by the robotic mower, the mowing module to a self-propelled operation when the robotic is in the mowed area.

a self-propelled module;
a mowing module, provided with a first working mode and a second working mode; and
a control unit for controlling the robotic mower;
wherein, when the robotic mower is in the first working mode, i.e. in a self-propelled mowing operation in a working area, the control unit is configured to record and mark the part of the working area that has been mowed in the first working mode as a mowed area, and wherein, when the robotic mower is entering the mowed area, the control unit is configured to control the robotic mower to work in second working mode, i.e. in a self-propelled operation.
